  "prefLabel": "Res 103.01 Requests for Information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 103.01 Requests for Information.\n\n(a) Requests for information, including but not limited to, requests made pursuant to RSA 91-A:4, the Right-to-Know Law, shall be made directly to the division described in Res 102 which is responsible for the operation of the program for which information is being requested.\n\n(b) All requests for information shall be addressed directly to the division as follows:\n\n172 Pembroke Road\n\nPO Box 1856\n\nConcord, NH 03302-1856\n\n(c) Telephone inquiries for information shall be addressed directly to the division as set forth in table 101.03 department telephone numbers.\n\nTable 101.03 Department Telephone Numbers\n\nOffice of the Commissioner (603) 271-2411\n\nBusiness Office (603) 271-3728\n\nDesign, Development and Maintenance (603) 271-2606\n\nDivision of Forests and Lands (603) 271-2215\n\nForest Protection Bureau (603) 271-2217\n\nForest Information and Planning Bureau (603) 271-3457\n\nLand Management Bureau (603) 271-3457\n\nForest Management Bureau (603) 271-3456\n\nDivision of Parks and Recreation (603) 271-3556\n\nTrails Bureau (603) 271-3254\n\nParks Bureau (603) 271-3627\n\nState Ski Operations Bureau (603) 271-2006\n\nDivision of Economic Development (603) 271-2341\n\nOffice of Business and Industrial Development (603) 271-2591\n\nOffice of International Commerce (603) 334-6074\n\nDivision of Travel and Tourism Development (603) 271-2665\n\n(d) All actual costs associated with providing requested information shall be paid by the requesting party.\n\nSource. #5798, eff 3-18-94, EXPIRED: 3-18-00\n\nNew. #7395, eff 11-1-00, EXPIRED: 7-1-18\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/res100.html"
}
